@startuml
hide footbox
autonumber
title US009 - To create a library

box "Tests" #LightYellow
actor User
participant ":UI" as UI
end box


participant ":CreateLibraryCtrl" as Ctrl
participant ":LibraryRepository" as LibraryRepo


User -> UI : I want to create a library.
activate UI
UI --> User : What name?
User -> UI : myFirstLib

UI -> Ctrl : CreateLibrary(myFirstLib)
activate Ctrl
Ctrl -> LibraryRepo : CreateLibrary(myFirstLib)
activate LibraryRepo

create "lib1:Library" as Library
LibraryRepo -> Library : create(myFirstLib)

LibraryRepo -> LibraryRepo : validate(lib1)
LibraryRepo -> LibraryRepo : add(lib1)


LibraryRepo --> Ctrl : true
deactivate LibraryRepo
Ctrl --> UI : Success
deactivate Ctrl
UI --> User : Your library was created
deactivate UI

@enduml